## headline

L3840x2160_420_8b t=1 (the disputed cell), in-process instrument, n=20:

    head/parent      0.9913  [0.9201..1.0739]  16/20  p=0.012
    headoff/parent   1.0303  [0.9024..1.1156]   3/20  p=0.003   seam alone
    head/headoff     0.9621  [0.8937..1.1044]  17/20  p=0.003   band alone
    main/parent      0.9724  [0.8531..1.0275]  17/20  p=0.003
    mainoff/parent   1.0060  [0.8899..1.1179]   8/20  p=0.503   main's seam

    bootstrap 95% CI of head/parent median: [0.9837..0.9968]
    P(5-round median >= 1.04) over all 15,504 draws of 5 from 20: 0.00%

Counterbalanced, the size sweep's OWN binaries on its OWN vector, n=11:

    szrs2/szrs       0.9913  [0.9391..1.0366]  10/11  p=0.012

v4k_8tile t=8, n=20: head/parent 0.7826, 20/20, p=0.0000, BAND-DISJOINT
(#482 reported 0.7845 idle / 0.7662 loaded).

VERDICT: #482 did not regress 4K 8bpc. The size sweep's 1.0854 does not
reproduce; its binaries, vector and fit give 0.9913 when re-measured.
